HIGHWAY ENFORCEMENT YIELDS RESULTS!

USBP agents, in coordination with the San Diego County Sheriff's Office, seized 27 pounds of cocaine during a traffic stop on Interstate 15 in Escondido, CA. A K9 alert led to the discovery of a concealed compartment containing narcotics. The U.S. citizen driver was arrested and faces state drug charges.

@usbpchiefsdc

